    'The mailer transport Craft is configured with, and whether what it needs is set: a sender address and, for SMTP, a host, and a user name and password when authentication is on. Credentials are reported only as present or missing; the host and port are named, so the service can be recognised.' => 'The mailer transport Craft is configured with, and whether what it needs is set: a sender address and, for SMTP, a host, and a user name and password when authentication is on. Credentials are reported only as present or missing; the host and port are named, so the service can be recognised.',
    'Looks at how many jobs have failed and, at normal depth and deeper, whether the same job keeps failing and — in dev mode or for an administrator, as Craft shows them — the errors they recorded; at what is waiting and for how long, and any job running longer than it said it would — then at the limits and the database jobs depend on.' => 'Looks at how many jobs have failed and, at normal depth and deeper, whether the same job keeps failing and — in dev mode or for an administrator, as Craft shows them — the errors they recorded; at what is waiting and for how long, and any job running longer than it said it would — then at the limits and the database jobs depend on.',
    'How many jobs have failed. At normal depth and deeper, whether the same job is failing repeatedly and the error each of the most recent recorded, which is shown in dev mode or to an administrator, as Craft shows it; a shallow run counts them only.' => 'How many jobs have failed. At normal depth and deeper, whether the same job is failing repeatedly and the error each of the most recent recorded, which is shown in dev mode or to an administrator, as Craft shows it; a shallow run counts them only.',
    'Whether the database’s character set and collation match what Craft is configured to use, and whether the table Craft itself uses as its indicator accepts four-byte characters. Other tables are not inspected.' => 'Whether the database’s character set and collation match what Craft is configured to use, and whether the table Craft itself uses as its indicator accepts four-byte characters. Other tables are not inspected.',
    'Looks at the state now of what a deployment changes — Craft, PHP, plugins, project config, migrations and the environment — then at the queue, filesystems and storage a new release depends on. Web Doctor does not record deployments, so it cannot say what a deployment changed or when.' => 'Looks at the state now of what a deployment changes — Craft, PHP, plugins, project config, migrations and the environment — then at the queue, filesystems and storage a new release depends on. Web Doctor does not record deployments, so it cannot say what a deployment changed or when.',
    'What the deployment actually changed, and when. Web Doctor records no deployments, so it compares nothing with how the site was before.' => 'What the deployment actually changed, and when. Web Doctor records no deployments, so it compares nothing with how the site was before.',
    'Related, but no registered check covers it' => 'Related, but no registered check covers it',
    'Not inspected by Web Doctor — worth inspecting by hand' => 'Not inspected by Web Doctor — worth inspecting by hand',
    'A recipe investigates a symptom rather than an issue. It ran the checks that cover what the symptom most often comes from. Any problem they found is recorded as an issue, and the causes below are weighed for the most serious of them.' => 'A recipe investigates a symptom rather than an issue. It ran the checks that cover what the symptom most often comes from. Any problem they found is recorded as an issue, and the causes below are weighed for the most serious of them.',
    'A recipe investigates a symptom. It runs the checks that cover what the symptom most often comes from, records what they report and the evidence they leave, and weighs the most serious problem they find against Web Doctor’s known causes. It changes nothing on the site. What it finds updates the Issue Center as any run does: a problem becomes or updates an issue, and an issue whose check no longer reports it is observed clear.' => 'A recipe investigates a symptom. It runs the checks that cover what the symptom most often comes from, records what they report and the evidence they leave, and weighs the most serious problem they find against Web Doctor’s known causes. It changes nothing on the site. What it finds updates the Issue Center as any run does: a problem becomes or updates an issue, and an issue whose check no longer reports it is observed clear.',
    'Each recipe says what it cannot inspect. Web Doctor does not read Craft’s, the web server’s or PHP’s logs, and does not capture the exceptions a site throws while serving requests; those are listed as not inspected, to be looked at by hand.' => 'Each recipe says what it cannot inspect. Web Doctor does not read Craft’s, the web server’s or PHP’s logs, and does not capture the exceptions a site throws while serving requests; those are listed as not inspected, to be looked at by hand.',
