    'Check which database this environment’s settings name. If it is the wrong one, correct the settings. If it is the right one and it should hold a site, restore it from a backup. Run `php craft install` only for a genuinely new installation.' => 'Check which database this environment’s settings name. If it is the wrong one, correct the settings. If it is the right one and it should hold a site, restore it from a backup. Run `php craft install` only for a genuinely new installation.',
    'The application state records Craft as not installed. Installing into a database that ought to hold a site would start the site again, empty, so which database it is has to be settled first.' => 'The application state records Craft as not installed. Installing into a database that ought to hold a site would start the site again, empty, so which database it is has to be settled first.',
    'Installing or restoring writes the whole database; done against the wrong one, it replaces a site.' => 'Installing or restoring writes the whole database; done against the wrong one, it replaces a site.',
