    'Finish or roll back the interrupted update' => 'Finish or roll back the interrupted update',
    'Craft sets maintenance mode while it updates and clears it when the update finishes, so still being in it usually means an update stopped part way, unless somebody switched it on deliberately.' => 'Craft sets maintenance mode while it updates and clears it when the update finishes, so still being in it usually means an update stopped part way, unless somebody switched it on deliberately.',
